[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19683.75, "timestamp": "05:28:03", "text": "永遠"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19695.11, "timestamp": "05:28:15", "text": "不知道自己什麼時候會說錯話。 讓我好好看看你。讓我看看你的笑話。呃。你買皮膚嗎？不，這些是別人的。 這些是別人的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19697.51, "timestamp": "05:28:17", "text": "我想我買的是皮膚。是的，那是我的槍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19711.83, "timestamp": "05:28:31", "text": "進了一個。這些是別人的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19725.67, "timestamp": "05:28:45", "text": "我想我買的是皮膚。是的，那是我的槍。主街上的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19732.628, "timestamp": "05:28:52", "text": "最後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19735.11, "timestamp": "05:28:55", "text": "一個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19738.23, "timestamp": "05:28:58", "text": "不，"}]